-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository does not include or redistribute any third-party model weights
or datasets. The code downloads or uses the following components at runtime;
each is governed by its own license, which you must review and accept
separately. The Apache License 2.0 of this repository does not apply to them.

- DINOv3 (Meta AI) - backbone weights loaded from Hugging Face
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3 - DINOv3 License (gated download)

- DINOv2 (Meta AI) - optional fallback backbone, loaded via torch.hub
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2 - Apache License 2.0

- LightGlue (ETH Zurich, Computer Vision and Geometry Group)
  https://github.com/cvg/LightGlue - Apache License 2.0

- SuperPoint weights (Magic Leap), used through the LightGlue package
  https://github.com/magicleap/SuperPointPretrainedNetwork
  Non-commercial research use only. Commercial use of this tracker's fine
  stage requires a different keypoint extractor or a license from Magic Leap.

- rembg / U^2-Net (background removal for template crops)
  https://github.com/danielgatis/rembg - MIT License

- got10k toolkit (benchmark evaluation)
  https://github.com/got-10k/toolkit - MIT License

